    [CI]upgrade memcache & memfabric to 1.3.0(20261010.5), torch_npu to 26.2.0(20261011.6), triton_ascend to 3.6.0(20261007182438) for daily image builds (#18399)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Upgrade the following components in daily image builds:
    • memcache and memfabric to 1.3.0(20261010.5)
    • torch_npu to 26.2.0(20261011.6)
    • triton_ascend to 3.6.0(20261007182438)
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No. Release images and end users are not impacted; these changes only
    affect daily image builds (build_type=daily).
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    Verified that memcache and memfabric, torch_npu, and triton_ascend in
    the built daily images are upgraded to 1.3.0(20261010.5),
    26.2.0(20261011.6), and 3.6.0(20261007182438) respectively.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/8cc9aa5ad350f6f80cf3bebb298d410803ff75a9
    
    Signed-off-by: duping <duping31@h-partners.com>

